Z||000012||ChopTop||09-17-2001||08:56 AM||||Looks like all that was done was a vinyl top was glued over the orginal top.  I'd imagine all you'd have to do is peel it off, viola, instant sunroof.  Remove the IMSA style spoiler and you have a stock Fiero.  Other than that the car looks like it's in decent shape.  Also, this car is in good company, I've have seen new Mercedes, Cadillacs and Lexus cars around here sport the fake convetible look.  For whatever reason there's is still a market for this look.  What we see as trashy some people see as classy...||||reg||1
